[00:05.00]Praise to the Lord, the Almighty
[00:10.50]The King of creation
[00:18.75]O my soul, praise Him, for He is thy health and salvation
[00:27.20]All ye who hear, now to His temple draw near
[00:34.80]Joining in glad adoration
[00:42.15]Praise to the Lord, who o'er all things so wondrously reigneth
[00:49.90]Shelters thee under His wings, yea, so gently sustaineth
[00:57.45]Hast thou not seen how thy desires e'er have been
[01:05.20]Granted in what He ordaineth
